    {
      "id": "claim_4b49055ab0e745c3b099f59cb602971e",
      "statement": "The error-prefix contract distinguishes HTTP 409 (proposal/profile/plan/catalog version mismatch or expiration) from HTTP 422 (edit violates a structural rule or catalog source is stale). 409 means the parent must reload or request a new proposal; 422 means the parent must change the edit.",
