    {
      "id": "claim_8dbde80e6ca342baa158280fd9ed5de2",
      "statement": "confirm() is idempotent: it checks for an existing plan with the same proposal_id before validation, so retrying the same request returns the already-inserted plan. Concurrent confirmations both see no previous plan, one inserts, and the other blocks on the row lock then returns the inserted row.",
