      "id": "claim_ceb86c9fe27241c7880c563489b136ac",
      "statement": "On successful confirmation, the transaction inserts a new immutable plan version, resolves all open plan_flags on superseded plans, and upserts child_goals for each covered goal with status active. Re-confirming an already-active goal preserves its original since_plan_version and source_intake_id.",
