      "statement": "Inside confirm(), version checks compare expected_plan_version, expected_proposal_version, intake_version, profile_version and policy_version against current database state, returning 409 on any mismatch. Source revalidation via stale_references() also returns 409 if a habit was withdrawn, superseded or removed, or a chapter version changed.",
